OL,3,GNEWSAMan, 26, charged with woman's
OL,4,Amurder
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been charged with the murder
OL,7,Fof a woman who was stabbed to death in
OL,8,Fa street in Manchester.
OL,10,FLawrence Johnson, 26, of Dorking
OL,11,FAvenue, has been charged with the
OL,12,Fmurder of Alisha Samuels, also 26, and
OL,13,Fthe attempted murder of a man following
OL,14,Fthe incident on Thursday.
OL,16,FHe has been remanded in custody and is
OL,17,Fdue to appear at Manchester
OL,18,FMagistrates' Court on Wednesday.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
